Error [E0307]: this `if` over `Int (a whole number)` has no `else` arm — range arms can't cover every value
  --> tests/ui/range_dispatch_missing_else.jet:4:5
    |
  4 |     if score == {
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `Int (a whole number)` has infinitely many values; range arms only cover a subset
 Fix: add `else -> { … }` to handle values not matched by any range
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0307
